        {
          "id": 474761361,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Please look for \"case PROTOCOL_BINARY_DCP_STREAM_REQUEST\" (1332).\n\nNote that `proto_item_add_bitmask_tree` takes `int** fields`, then you won't find a call with `NULL`, but a call with \n\n```\nint * const flags[] = { NULL };\n```\n\nthat is what causes the crash in the testcase.",
          "author": {
            "id": 277876,
            "username": "crondaemon",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Dario Lombardo",
